warning shiftSignedInt64BitsRight "sdiv rounds toward zero, not toward minus-infinity â€” differs from C's >> on negative operands when bitIndex > 0."
guarantee shiftSignedInt64BitsRight "Terminates after bitIndex iterations."
label startShiftSignedInt64BitsRight
memory shiftSignedInt64BitsRight mutable rightShiftDivisorAccumulator I64 1
memory shiftSignedInt64BitsRight mutable rightShiftIteration I64 0
