call detectRightShiftDoneCall math.greaterThanOrEqualI64
argument detectRightShiftDoneCall left I64 rightShiftIteration
argument detectRightShiftDoneCall right I64 bitIndex
run detectRightShiftDoneCall
bind value rightShiftDone Bool detectRightShiftDoneCall
branch if condition rightShiftDone target applyRightShiftDivision
call doubleRightShiftDivisorCall math.multiplyI64
argument doubleRightShiftDivisorCall left I64 rightShiftDivisorAccumulator
argument doubleRightShiftDivisorCall right I64 integerTwoBaseValue
run doubleRightShiftDivisorCall
bind value doubledRightShiftDivisor I64 doubleRightShiftDivisorCall
set memory rightShiftDivisorAccumulator doubledRightShiftDivisor
call incrementRightShiftIterationCall math.addI64
argument incrementRightShiftIterationCall left I64 rightShiftIteration
argument incrementRightShiftIterationCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run incrementRightShiftIterationCall
bind value nextRightShiftIteration I64 incrementRightShiftIterationCall
set memory rightShiftIteration nextRightShiftIteration
jump target rightShiftLoop
label applyRightShiftDivision
call divideInputByDivisorCall math.divideI64
argument divideInputByDivisorCall left I64 inputValue
argument divideInputByDivisorCall right I64 rightShiftDivisorAccumulator
run divideInputByDivisorCall
bind value shiftedRightResult CSignedInt64 divideInputByDivisorCall
return value shiftedRightResult

